COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.competency.statement IS 'The text of the statement. The textual content that either describes a specific competency or describes a less granular group of competencies within the taxonomy of the competency framework.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.competency.url IS 'A network-resolvable Uniform Resource Locator (URL) pointing to the authoritative reference for the competency definition';
