COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.competency.current_version_indicator IS 'Indicates that this is the most current version of the Competency Definition';
COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.competency.version IS 'A label assigned by the publisher indicating the version of the competency framework statement';
COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.competency.blooms_taxonomy_domain IS 'Classification of the Competency Definition using Bloom''s Taxonomy Domains';
COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.competency.language IS 'The default language of the text used for the content in the competency definition statement';
COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.competency.multiple_intelligence IS 'Classification of the Competency Definition using intelligences defined for Howard Earl Gardner''s Theory of Multiple Intelligences';
COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.competency.locked_for_editing_indicator IS 'Indicates whether the competency is locked for editing';
