COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.course_lookup.repeat_code IS 'Indicates how the course repeat should be computed in the student''s academic grade average';
COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.course_lookup.academic_grade_scale_code IS 'The grading scale used by an academic educational institution for an academic course';
COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.course_lookup.certification_name_association IS 'A description of the certification or recognition associated with this course (ex. Networking, CAD, etc.)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.course_lookup.code_system IS 'A system that is used to identify the organization of subject matter and related learning experiences provided for the instruction of persons';
COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.course_lookup.contact_minutes IS 'The actual or estimated number of clock minutes required for course completion. This number is especially important for career and technical education course and may represent (in minutes) the clock hour requirement of the course, the number of minutes (or clock hours) of class time per week, times the number of equivalent weeks the class typically meets.';
