COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.course_lookup.estimated_cost IS 'Estimated cost of a course';
COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.course_lookup.language_of_instruction IS 'The primary language or languages of the entity, even if it makes use of other languages (e.g. a course offered in English to teach Spanish would have an inLanguage of English, while a credential in Quebec could have an inLanguage of both French and English)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.course_lookup.learning_standard IS 'Learning standard(s) to be taught by the course';
COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.course_lookup.online_availability IS 'Online location where the course can be pursued';
