COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.course_lookup.level_characteristic IS 'An indication of the general nature and difficulty of instruction provided throughout a course';
COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.course_lookup.applicable_education_level IS 'The education level, grade level or primary instructional level at which a course is intended';
COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.course_lookup.interaction_mode IS 'The primary type of interaction, synchronous or asynchronous, defined for the course';
COMMENT ON COLUMN academics.course_lookup.nces_college_course_map_code IS 'The code from the taxonomy system for coding postsecondary courses in NCES research studies';
